{"4122380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mr. Grin's Final Act", "steam_appid": 4122380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thirty years ago, a tragedy closed the studio forever. </i><br><i>Now you're back... So is Mr. Grin.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong> badges, <strong>rewire</strong> circuits, <strong>crack</strong> safes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> abandoned TV sets from the 80s. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover</strong> what really happened that night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One sound and <strong>you die</strong>.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's not only <strong>hunting</strong> you. He's <strong>directing</strong> you. <br><strong>His</strong> script. <strong>Your</strong> survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122380/extras/350055dccb7fd5cce6828a203849c4c8.poster.avif?t=1785066255\" width=624 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122380/extras/350055dccb7fd5cce6828a203849c4c8.webm?t=1785066255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122380/extras/350055dccb7fd5cce6828a203849c4c8.mp4?t=1785066255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122380/extras/fb8c167cf940ac27e9810d47c909aa03.avif?t=1785066255\" width=624 height=102 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walk</strong> <strong>through</strong> abandoned TV sets frozen in time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>dressing rooms</strong> to <strong>control booths</strong>, every room tells part of a story no one was meant to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122380/extras/fd3a9f3eecc37e2f0b78208c93338468.poster.avif?t=1785066255\" width=624 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122380/extras/fd3a9f3eecc37e2f0b78208c93338468.webm?t=1785066255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122380/extras/fd3a9f3eecc37e2f0b78208c93338468.mp4?t=1785066255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122380/extras/06e47ff400d5f2210f6fc62bf1c8156c.avif?t=1785066255\" width=625 height=107 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every</strong> room hides a clue, <strong>every</strong> object a purpose. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong> what you can. Nothing is there by accident. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The studio <strong>doesn't give second chances</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122380/extras/71a057c79859e3eaffff48357b5ef46a.poster.avif?t=1785066255\" width=624 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122380/extras/71a057c79859e3eaffff48357b5ef46a.webm?t=1785066255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122380/extras/71a057c79859e3eaffff48357b5ef46a.mp4?t=1785066255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></v